1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,795
M: Hello.

2
00:00:01,435 --> 00:00:05,890
This morning, I received a box of clothes I ordered from your company, but there's a slight problem.

3
00:00:06,495 --> 00:00:09,585
When I opened the box, one of the items I ordered was missing.

4
00:00:10,255 --> 00:00:12,240
W: I'm terribly sorry to hear that, sir.

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,855
Could you give me your personal information, please?

6
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:22,275
M: My name is Ian Caldwell, and my order number was 98449-12.

7
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:26,135
The missing item was product number CR403.

8
00:00:27,415 --> 00:00:27,830
W: All right.

9
00:00:28,275 --> 00:00:30,585
We're going to send you the item by express mail.

10
00:00:31,055 --> 00:00:32,295
It should arrive by Thursday.

11
00:00:32,965 --> 00:00:33,235
M: Excellent.

12
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,775
I really appreciate it.

13
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:40,435
W: I'll also include a coupon good for twenty percent off your next order as our way of apologizing.
